  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 932284,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 15 Seconds Parallel Copy System 2.1: A Commodore 64 Adventure\n\nPrepare for a mind-bending journey through time and space in *15 Seconds Parallel Copy System 2.1*! As a skilled technician, you're thrust into a desperate mission: to repair a catastrophic anomaly threatening to unravel reality. A parallel copy system, designed to stabilize temporal distortions, has malfunctioned, creating dangerous rifts and paradoxes.\n\nYour task is to navigate a series of increasingly complex levels, each representing a fractured timeline. Using a unique \"copy\" mechanic, you must rapidly duplicate yourself to solve puzzles, overcome obstacles, and defeat bizarre, time-warped creatures. Each copy exists for only 15 seconds before vanishing, demanding precision and strategic thinking.\n\nExplore vibrant, pixel-art environments, ranging from futuristic laboratories to prehistoric jungles, all warped by the temporal instability. Discover hidden secrets, unlock powerful upgrades, and unravel the mystery behind the system’s failure. Can you master the parallel copy system and restore order to the timeline before it's too late? A challenging and innovative experience awaits!"
    },
